Now my elder brother Diego arrives.
He sits near Sofia.
There is a smile on her face too.
Diego looks at me and smiles.
"Maya, how is your office?" he asks.
I speak happily.
"My office is good," I say.
"There is one new colleague of mine there."
"His name is Rohan."
Diego asks, "Who is Rohan?"
"He is a software engineer," I say.
"He is very helpful."
"He helps in my work."
Diego asks again, "How are the other people there?"
"All the people are good," I say.
"I am happy here."
"You too come to Mumbai," I tell him.
He laughs loudly.
